: 2021, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 480452, "date": 1685577600, "platform": 49, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 2, "region": "north_america"}}, {"id": 306117, "date": 1632787200, "platform": 48, "y": 2021, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 306118, "date": 1632787200, "platform": 6, "y": 2021, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 296311, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6cmv.jpg"}, {"id": 296310, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6cmu.jpg"}, {"id": 296313, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6cmx.jpg"}, {"id": 296308, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6cms.jpg"}, {"id": 296309, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6cmt.jpg"}, {"id": 296312, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6cmw.jpg"}, {"id": 296314, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6cmy.jpg"}], "slug": "away-the-survival-series", "storyline": "A storm is coming.\nSet in a distant future, a series of natural disasters threatens the survival of every species on the planet. As you venture deeper into the wilderness, do you have what it takes to make it out alive?\n\nInspired by nature documentaries, AWAY: The Survival Series is a 3rd-person adventure game that takes you on the Sugar Glider's breathtaking journey into the wild.\n\nAs cataclysmic storms bear down on the planet, you must travel across vast environments in search of safer lands. From the mighty treetops to the forest floor, immerse yourself in nature as you explore a vibrant world brimming with life, but beware of the dangers that await on your journey...\n\nIMMERSE YOURSELF IN NATURE\nWatch the world around you come to life as you explore a rich diversity of stunning environments and uncover the hidden life that lies deep within the forests, caverns, and swamps.\n\nBECOME THE SUGAR GLIDER\nSitting near the bottom of the food chain, the Sugar Glider makes up for its small size with superior agility as you jump, climb, and glide through your surroundings.\n\nEXPLORE A RICH ECOSYSTEM\nFrom tiny insects to mighty beasts, the world of AWAY is filled with animals of all shapes and sizes. But you must be cautious, as dangerous predators await in these troubled lands\u2026\n\nENCHANTING MUSICAL SCORE\nHaving worked on hundreds of major game and movie soundtracks, including the Planet Earth II and Life nature documentaries, Mike Raznick brings his experience as a multi-award winning composer and audio director to AWAY with an enchanting orchestral score.\n\nABOUT BREAKING WALLS\nBreaking Walls is an independent game studio founded by industry veterans in Montr\u00e9al. With decades of experience working on major AAA titles such as Assassin's Creed, Prince of Persia, and Far Cry, our team has spent the last three years developing AWAY.", "summary": "Inspired by nature documentaries, Away: The Survival Series takes you on the Sugar Glider's breathtaking journey into the wild. As cataclysmic storms bear down on the planet, immerse yourself in nature and explore a vibrant world brimming with life, but beware of the dangers that lie ahead...", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 34, "name": "Educational"}, {"id": 35, "name": "Kids"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/away-the-survival-series", "videos": [{"id": 28448, "name": "Gameplay video", "video_id": "RFg50LOlbFM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RFg50LOlbFM", "title": "AWAY: The Survival Series | Gameplay Sneak Peek", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RFg50LOlbFM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 25870, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "BZ-jLJElB9o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZ-jLJElB9o", "title": "AWAY: The Survival Series | Official Teaser", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BZ-jLJElB9o/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 55423, "name": "Trailer - Japanese", "video_id": "FWA1R0bdYu8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/wat